    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d704">

                <pb facs="0849" n="755" xml:id="pg755"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-03-18"><hi rendition="#italic">March 18, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received March 19.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>My affirmation of the American citizenship of Julio Sanguily having been
                    comprobated and authenticated by the civil government of the Province of Habana,
                    the Governor-General has ordered his transfer from the military to the civil
                    jurisdiction for trial in accordance with protocol twelve January,
                    seventy-seven, as I asked on the 26th ultimo.</p>
            </div>
